,4)\\,⟺\\,a≡b\\,(\\text{mod}\\,4)\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. By statement I and the first property, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a≡b\\,(\\text{mod}\\,4)\\,⟺\\,4a≡4b\\,(\\text{mod}\\,16)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""}]}
